Speed Factor: 6
Proficiency Type: Shortbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Coldfire Bow +2"
	SAY DESC "Crafted during the fall of Myth Drannor, this elegant shortbow is a masterpiece of contradictory wizardry. To forge it, an elven bladesinger bound a minor fire elemental to the upper limb and an ice spirit to the lower limb.These opposing forces are kept in a perpetual, tense balance by a core of crystallized magic in the grip. When drawn, arrows are cloaked in a volatile, violet flame that burns with both blistering heat and absolute zero. This elemental friction creates an arcane aura around the wielder, shielding them from hostile spells and extreme temperatures.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Fire Resistance: +5%
– Cold Resistance: +5%

THAC0: +2
Damage: +2, +2 fire/cold damage
Speed Factor: 4
Proficiency Type: Shortbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength

Weight: 2"




